4. Use ONLY the data you were handed (e.g. a map grid, a key value). Never
   invent, assume, or fetch data you were not given.
5. If the question asks for "the last N digits", slice the string of the
   result: `result = str(value)[-N:]`, and keep any leading zeros.
6. Available modules: math, itertools, functools, collections, re, decimal,
   fractions, string. There is no file, network, os, eval or import of
